      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since reconfiguring the backend is potentially dangerous is there any reason why this isn\u0027t in the __init__?  It is possible to create an instance of KeyValueStore and use it without calling configure?",
      "revId": "4b91f56fafce50619cdf26370cb851b40838587e",
